		{"id":"9d869a168824906b","type":"text","text":"## 🖼️ Banner","x":-440,"y":-760,"width":760,"height":140},
		{"id":"b885a504aa64df5c","type":"text","text":"I'm Russ Lebo, an experience designer and creative technologist. This is the source for my portfolio, [dataink.io](https://dataink.io/).\n\nI designed and built it as a static site. The design system comes from Figma, the content from Sanity, and a GSAP motion layer sits on top using explicit event contracts. I treat the motion as optional: the page works without it.","x":-440,"y":-340,"width":760,"height":160},
		{"id":"97c4a3e511dfc7da","type":"text","text":"## 🖼️ Homepage Screenshot","x":-440,"y":-340,"width":760,"height":160},
		{"id":"4ee43b3e1b9d309c","type":"text","text":"## Audiences\n- public portfolio\n- GitHub repo and documentation\n- posterity (i.e. me)","x":-441,"y":-160,"width":761,"height":180},
